### 8. Monitoring and Review

**Continuous Improvement**  
GTS will conduct annual audits of its cybersecurity policies and incident response procedures. The CISO will lead these audits, with findings reported to the Board of Directors.

**Policy Review Schedule**  
This policy will be reviewed annually by the Cybersecurity Policy Committee, with updates made as necessary to address emerging threats and changes in compliance requirements.

